OL,3,GNEWSACould Live Nation deal to run
OL,4,ATropicana be in doubt?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has said it was
OL,7,Funclear whether a multinational events
OL,8,Fpromoter would pull out of running one
OL,9,Fof Weston-super-Mare's most iconic
OL,10,Fvenues.
OL,12,FIt was announced earlier in the year
OL,13,Fthat Live Nation was in talks to take
OL,14,Fover the Tropicana and run the former
OL,15,Flido as a 10,000-capacity venue.
OL,17,FHowever, councillors in North Somerset
OL,18,Fhave voted to cap capacity at 5,000
OL,19,Fpeople because of budget constraints.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
