OL,3,GNEWSACould Live Nation deal to run
OL,4,ATropicana be in doubt?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mike Bell said he would
OL,7,F"continue to have conversations" with
OL,8,FLive Nation about the deal. The company
OL,9,Fhas not replied to requests for a
OL,10,Fcomment.
